00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.600
OK, some interesting. So I actually am glad
to see on the David Pakman show sub Reddit

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:13.150
this morning, which is of course David Pakman
dot com slash r e d DHT. A post asking is

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:19.449
Trump making a comeback linking to a bunch
of different polling data, which seems to

00:00:19.449 --> 00:00:27.849
suggest that the huge lead that Biden maybe
had about a month ago may be narrowing now.

00:00:27.849 --> 00:00:33.500
I am going to make the case in the next segment
that there is no such lead. It's not a question

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.840
of it's narrowing. It's. It does not exist.
And I will make the mathematical case. I will

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:42.960
make a qualitative case for you as well. And
I'm really glad that people on the sub Reddit

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:46.860
are discussing that now.
Also, I don't want to spend a lot of time

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:55.670
on this, but there have been allegations made
that I eat mac and cheese with a spoon, which

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:58.290
is really weird.
Like if you need a spoon for mac and cheese,

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:04.720
it's really like a pasta soup. I use spoons
only for desserts and soups, not for pasta.

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:11.350
And I guess that in some circles this is considered
controversial. But yes, I do eat mac and cheese

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:15.000
with a fork. I think that that's the correct
utensil. This is not really important given

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.940
everything that we have going on. But somehow
this triggered a lot of people in my audience

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:22.560
and I really don't know why. So if that's
something you want to weigh in on, the place

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:29.010
to do it would be the David Pakman show. Subrata
David Pakman dot com slash r e d d i t.

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:33.670
But the focus here really important to get
back to the material, important, materially

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:39.770
important things. I don't know when people
talk about is Trump making a comeback? I don't

00:01:39.770 --> 00:01:44.960
know that Donald Trump needs to make a comeback.
And that's what I want to really focus in

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:45.140
on next.

